SUMMARY:Polyphony Concert
DESCRIPTION:Polyphony: Practicing Harmony\nA concert and conversation with Polyphony. \nFounded in 2012\, Polyphony Education uses classical music and the arts to build bridges between Arab and Jewish communities in Israel. Through innovative programs and ensembles\, Polyphony brings diverse communities together to foster empathy\, equality\, mutual respect\, and partnership. \n  \nOPEN TO ALL • $18/Member or Nonmember \nPURCHASE TICKETS\n  \nRead more about Polyphony from New Jersey Jewish News here \nPresented by Temple B’Nai Abraham and JCC MetroWest.
URL:https://jccmetrowest.org/event/polyphony-concert/
LOCATION:JCC MetroWest | Maurice Levin Theater\, 760 Northfield Ave\, West Orange\, NJ\, 07052\, United States
CATEGORIES:Special Event,The Gaelen
