SUMMARY:Life Long Learning: Balance and Falls
DESCRIPTION:A RWJ Barnabas Health/Cooperman Barnabas Medical Center Lecture\nLearn how to identify fall risks\, improve balance\, and move safely during everyday activities. Gain practical strategies to reduce your risk of falling and stay active\, independent\, and confident. \nAbout the speaker: Dr. Kristen Vasconcelos\, PT\, DPT\, provides personalized\, evidence-based care for her patients. Her movement-focused approach helps them recover\, prevent injury\, and return to the activities they love. \nFREE to all. Reservations strongly encouraged. \nRegister Here
URL:https://jccmetrowest.org/event/lll-balance-and-falls/
LOCATION:JCC MetroWest | Tepper Hall\, 760 Northfield Ave\, West Orange\, NJ\, 07052\, United States
