SUMMARY:One Community Event: Bruce Feiler in Conversation with Rabbi Angela Buchdahl
DESCRIPTION:Bruce Feiler will be in conversation with Rabbi Angela Buchdahl about his book\, A Time to Gather: How Ritual Created the World and How it Came to Save Us. \nAbout the speaker: Bruce Feiler is the author of seven New York Times bestsellers\, including Life Is in the Transitions and The Secrets of Happy Families. \nFREE for JCC Member; $15 Nonmember \nThe audience will be in person; Bruce Feiler and Rabbi Buchdahl will join via Zoom. \nRegister Here\n  \nSponsored by: \n             
