SUMMARY:Touch a Truck
DESCRIPTION:You’re Going to Dig This Fundraising Event\nGet up close and check out an assortment of vehicles you may have seen on the streets around your town.  Meet first responders from local Fire/Police Departments.  Chat with construction site equipment operators and school bus drivers. Hear how their unique vehicle operates and helps them do their special job. \nLocation: South Outdoor Parking Lot\n(Park in covered garage and then take sidewalk path up to the South Parking Lot) \nCost: $20 per family (pay in advance or $25 at the door) \nSnacks available for purchase \nRegister Here\nMoney raised for this event goes to towards the betterment of our Early Childhood Center
URL:https://jccmetrowest.org/event/touch-a-truck-2026/
LOCATION:JCC MetroWest\, 760 Northfield Ave\, West Orange\, NJ\, 07052\, United States
