SUMMARY:Mah Jongg Lesson Series
DESCRIPTION:Lessons for Beginners – your first hand starts here! \nGather your friends and discover the ancient game of Mah Jongg! This fun evening is the perfect way to satisfy your curiosity.\nIf you have a Mah Jongg set\, please bring it along. \nLesson Dates: 10/21\, 10/29\, 11/4\nDeadline to register: Monday\, October 19 \nFee: $72/participant (3 lessons) \nSnacks\, coffee\, tea provided \nNote: Please plan to attend all three sessions! Each lesson builds on the last\, helping you gain the skills and confidence to start playing on your own. \nRegister Here\n  \nAdvance payment required for registration. Space is limited!\nNo refunds.
URL:https://jccmetrowest.org/event/mah-jongg-lesson-series2026/
LOCATION:JCC MetroWest | Tepper Hall\, 760 Northfield Ave\, West Orange\, NJ\, 07052\, United States
